Package: funresMech
Title: Mechanistic Functional Response Analysis
Version: 1.0.4
Authors@R: 
    person('Segundo', 'Núñez-Campero', 
           email = 'segundo.nc@conicet.gov.ar', 
           role = c('aut', 'cre'))
Description: Implements the mechanistic functional response
  model proposed by Okuyama (2012) <doi:10.1016/j.biocontrol.2011.10.008> for 
  host-parasitoid systems. Provides tools for model fitting, likelihood 
  profiling, stochastic simulation, and visualization of parasitism 
  distributions.
  Includes an interactive 'shiny' application for complete analysis workflows,
  built with 'plotly' for interactive graphics and 'rmarkdown' for
  reproducible reports.
